    <briefdescription>
<para>S3 writer for uploading objects. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Handles uploading data to S3 using PUT requests with AWS Signature V4 authentication. Supports single-shot uploads (entire object in one PUT request). </para>
    </detaileddescription>
